  58:   - Seoul cultural-events adapter is optional at runtime and active only when `SEOUL_OPEN_DATA_KEY` exists.
  59:   - If live source fails or key is absent, the tool must return fixture-labeled output only when `FAMILY_EXPERIENCE_ALLOW_FIXTURE=true`; otherwise return a safe error result with `isError: true`.
  60: - Golden prompt coverage:
