### .prd-session/2026-07-01-three-concept-debate/family-experience-mcp/quality-gate-2026-07-02.md
   1: # OML Quality Gate - family-experience-mcp
   2: 
   3: Date: 2026-07-02 KST
   4: 
   5: ## Harness Route
   6: 
